title: "Box 14.7.1, Figure 1 | Four technology categories act through four integration modes across sectors, systems and markets"
abstract: "Digitalisation for cross-sectoral integration. Four technology categories (left) act through four integration modes (centre) across sectors, systems and markets (right). The lower panel summarises integration outcomes and trade-offs: system flexibility and variable renewable energy integration (assessed in 14.7.4), implications for costs and potentials (assessed with 14.8), and systemic risks and distributional implications (assessed in 14.7.5). Categories describe what the technologies are. Modes describe the functions they perform in operation, and one technology may operate in several modes."
